{"4013680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Cursed Grave", "steam_appid": 4013680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sea was supposed to take you — but something else had other plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken on a remote island, your ship broken and the shoreline silent. Above you, a forgotten castle looms like a wound in the sky. Something is wrong here. Something is watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awake...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cursed Grave is a first-person psychological horror experience focused on atmosphere, tension, and exploration. With no weapons and no clear escape, you must navigate the island and the decaying castle at its heart — all while something stalks you from the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is small but open, a place lost to time and covered in secrets. From abandoned paths to sealed chambers, you'll piece together the history of this cursed place — and your unwanted role in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sound matters. Every step counts. The line between reality and hallucination blurs the longer you stay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not a fighter. You must hide, run, or think your way through. Solve puzzles, unlock forgotten doors, and stay ahead of whatever hunts you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The island brought you here for a reason.</strong><br><strong>It may not let you leave.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sea was supposed to take you — but something else had other plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken on a remote island, your ship broken and the shoreline silent. Above you, a forgotten castle looms like a wound in the sky. Something is wrong here. Something is watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awake...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cursed Grave is a first-person psychological horror experience focused on atmosphere, tension, and exploration. With no weapons and no clear escape, you must navigate the island and the decaying castle at its heart — all while something stalks you from the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is small but open, a place lost to time and covered in secrets. From abandoned paths to sealed chambers, you'll piece together the history of this cursed place — and your unwanted role in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sound matters. Every step counts. The line between reality and hallucination blurs the longer you stay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not a fighter. You must hide, run, or think your way through. Solve puzzles, unlock forgotten doors, and stay ahead of whatever hunts you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The island brought you here for a reason.</strong><br><strong>It may not let you leave.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Trapped on a forgotten island after a shipwreck, you must explore a decaying castle and uncover the island’s dark secrets. In this first-person psychological horror, there are no weapons — only fear, stealth, and the will to survive.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013680/f39a2d3d6726c9097a7192aaad87ae6899beab9f/header.jpg?t=1761914612", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013680/e7da5dbc7f25d76f90e78b2d0df2f719ae159542/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761914612", "capsule_imagev5": "